        "TileImage": "$($repository f0041173-59d1-4e97-8a2e-44e104ca4202).Image",
        "Description": "The order is active. Strict isolation from the patient is mandatory, and violating this rule will result in death. Your task today is to prevent this infection from spreading, while the infected patient is still being treated. \r\rAll deaths will be ruled as labour accidents. The cleaners we have working from the inside will take care of the bodies, but due to infection risk, it is very important that you mantain your initial suit. \r\rGood luck!",
